      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GUARANTOR (5) steps up in class after gripping on to a nose win here last week on a soft track. He will carry half a kilo less this time, and from a good gate, he will take plenty of pegging back again, especially if the track is wet again. LAST STYLEBENDER (1) is a handy gelding who also likes to lead in his races, so he may make things interesting early on with the top pick. He is nicely placed at this level after a 1.5kg claim, and another good effort is on the cards. KING'S DRAMA (2) made up plenty of late ground here 11 days ago over this trip when finishing fourth. He slides down in class, and can have the last say, so watch for him late. SNIP OF ROMANCE (8) is another speedy customer, and he may have to take a sit this time with all that pace underneath him in the draw. Keep him safe. ANABALLISTIC (6) resumes from a spell, and both of his career wins have been when fresh up in the past. He is trial fit and ready to rumble.",
